{
  "about": "SPEC-reclaim.md section 6. Each scenario: the programs installed, what each answers (argv prefix after sudo), the files in the home, the lines typed; the expected exit status, the commands that change the machine in order ('root ' when run through sudo), and the files left in the home. TestScenarios runs the Go; CLAUDE/Plan/00192-.../reclaim-parity/parity.py runs the bash and the built Go. bashDiffers names the departure where the bash is expected to differ.",
